    "sub_ename": "STATISTICS(1)",
    "describe_ch": "介紹統計的基本分析方法，包括敘述統計、機率、離散型隨機變數、連續型隨機變數、抽樣分配、假設檢定與信賴區間、雙樣本檢定。",
    "describe_eh": "Introduction to basic analytical methods, including descriptive statistics, probabilities, discrete random variables, continuous random variables, sampling distribution, hypothesis testing and confidence interval, two sample testing",
